  priority: 65
  category: 0
  revisitTitle: One play per head
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - 'That musician already played. Each of them gets ONE composition and ONE action
    per loop; whatever''s left waits for the next one. Before the song starts, same
    rule: one and one. Four musicians means four turns inside your turn. Spread them
    out.'
  highlightKey: hand
  mechanicText: 'Play refused: this musician''s <link=budget>budget</link> for the
    <link=period>period</link> is spent. One <link=composition_card>composition card</link>
    and one <link=action_card>action card</link> per musician per period. Unspent
    plays do not carry over.'
